    image: "/images/pkg-crater.png",
    isFeatured: false,
    author: "Ijen Expedition Team",
    content: "Mount Ijen's nature reserve is managed by **BBKSDA Jawa Timur (Balai Besar Konservasi Sumber Daya Alam)**. To protect the fragile volcanic crater ecosystem and guarantee visitor safety, tickets are issued through an **online quota registration system**.\n\n---\n\n## Official Entry Permit Pricing (Tarif Tiket Masuk)\n\nTicket rates differ for domestic Indonesian citizens and international foreign visitors:\n\n| Visitor Category | Weekday Rate (Senin–Jumat) | Weekend & Holiday Rate (Sabtu–Minggu) | Insurance |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Domestic (WNI)** | IDR 5,000 / person | IDR 7,500 / person | IDR 2,000 |\n| **International (WNA)** | IDR 100,000 / person | IDR 150,000 / person | IDR 5,000 |\n\n*Note: Rates are set in accordance with Government Regulation PP No. 12/2014 and BBKSDA East Java updates.*\n\n---\n\n## Daily Visitor Quota Limits\n\n- BBKSDA caps daily visitor permits to approximately **2,000 visitors per day** under normal volcanic activity (Level I Normal).\n- During long weekends, holiday seasons (Eid, Christmas, New Year), and peak European summer travel months (July–September), tickets often **sell out days in advance**.\n- **Important**: Walk-in ticket counters at Paltuding are frequently closed when online quotas are filled. Booking in advance online is strongly recommended.\n\n---\n\n## How to Book Online: Step-by-Step\n\n1. **Visit the Official Portal**: Open the BBKSDA booking website at `ticket.bbksdajatim.org`.\n2. **Select Destination**: Choose **TWA Kawah Ijen**.\n3. **Choose Trekking Date**: Pick your desired climb date. Note that gate opens at 02:00 AM WIB on the morning of your booked date.\n4. **Enter Visitor Data**: Input full names, nationality, identification number (Passport or KTP), and phone number exactly matching your official IDs.\n5. **Payment**: Complete payment via virtual account transfer, QRIS, or Indonesian bank channels within the designated time limit.\n6. **Download Electronic Ticket (e-Ticket)**: Save the PDF containing your official QR Code / Barcode to your smartphone and print a backup physical copy.\n\n---\n\n## At the Paltuding Checkpoint\n\nUpon arrival at the basecamp:\n- Present your **e-Ticket barcode** to the ranger verification counter.\n- Present your **matching physical Passport/KTP**.\n- Present your **original Medical Health Certificate**.\n- Once verified, you will receive entrance wristbands or validated passes allowing entry past the security turnstiles."
